<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Coefficient of a term in a binomial expansion</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Find the coefficient of \(x^{@r@}\) in the expansion of \({@brs@}\). Give a number, not a term.</p><div>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>The term in \(x^{@r@}\) takes number \({@r@}\) of the row for power \({@n@}\) (counting from 0), the first term to the power \({@n-r@}\) and the second term to the power \({@r@}\). It is the {@pos@} term.</p><p>Number \({@r@}\) of the row for power \({@n@}\) is \({@C@}\). The term is</p><p>\[{@C@} \times {@a@}^{@n-r@} \times \left({@bx@}\right)^{@r@} = {@C@} \times {@an@} \times {@brd@}x^{@r@} = {@term@}\]</p><p>so the coefficient of \(x^{@r@}\) is \({@ta@}\).</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[ordn(m) := if m=1 then "1st" else if m=2 then "2nd" else if m=3 then "3rd" else sconcat(m,"th");
/* Design: coefficient of a term in (a + cx)^n. Source: adapted from SMP AS/A2 Core 2, Chapter 5, Exercise C, question 6. */
L: [[6,2,2,-3],[8,5,3,-2],[9,2,2,3],[6,2,3,2],[7,3,2,-3],[8,6,3,-2],[7,5,2,-3],[7,2,2,-3],[9,7,3,-2],[6,5,2,-3]];
ix: 1+rand(10);
n: L[ix][1];
r: L[ix][2];
a: L[ix][3];
b: L[ix][4];
brs: sconcat("\\left(",a,if b>0 then "+" else "-",abs(b),"x\\right)^{",n,"}");
C: binomial(n,r);
Cm: binomial(n,r-1);
an: a^(n-r);
br: b^r;
ta: C*an*br;
noa: C*br;
nobp: C*an*b;
neg: -ta;
slip: Cm*an*br;
swp: C*a^r*b^(n-r);
bx: b*x;
term: ta*x^r;
pos: ordn(r+1);
brd: if br<0 then sconcat("(",br,")") else string(br);]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
  <specificfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[]]></text></specificfeedback>
